  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_0503.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Los escritores Javi Aguilella, V&iacute;ctor Al&oacute;s Yus, de Onda, y Carlos Rodr&iacute;guez Garrido, de Valencia, han firmado ejemplares de sus obras, en el transcurso de la I Feria del Libro de Tales.</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/VicenteCazorlaRamosConSergioVallesFeriaLibroTales.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Despu&eacute;s ha actuado el cantautor Vicente Cazorla Ramos.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/signaturafirallibrestales/img_0499.jpg\" alt=\"img_0499\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/signaturafirallibrestales/img_0500.jpg\" alt=\"img_0500\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/signaturafirallibrestales/img_0502.jpg\" alt=\"img_0502\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/signaturafirallibrestales/img_0503.jpg\" alt=\"img_0503\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/signaturafirallibrestales/vicentecazorlaramosconsergiovallesferialibrotales.jpg\" alt=\"vicentecazorlaramosconsergiovallesferialibrotales\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/signaturafirallibrestales/vicentecazorlaramosconsergiovallesferialibrotales2.jpg\" alt=\"vicentecazorlaramosconsergiovallesferia